###
# DefenDDoS Backend API - Comprehensive Test Suite
# Use with VS Code REST Client extension
# All 21 endpoints covered
###

@baseUrl = http://localhost:8082
@mlUrl = http://localhost:8000

###############################################################################
# 1. HEALTH CHECKS
###############################################################################

### 1.1 Backend Health Check
GET {{baseUrl}}/actuator/health
Accept: application/json

### 1.2 Backend Info
GET {{baseUrl}}/actuator/info
Accept: application/json

### 1.3 ML Service Health Check
GET {{mlUrl}}/health
Accept: application/json

### 1.4 ML Service Health via Backend
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/traffic/ml-health
Accept: application/json

### 1.5 InfluxDB Health Check
GET http://localhost:8086/health
Accept: application/json


###############################################################################
# 2. TRAFFIC MANAGEMENT - Normal Traffic
###############################################################################

### 2.1 Ingest Normal Traffic (Safe IP)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/traffic/ingest
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "sourceIp": "192.168.1.1",
  "destinationIp": "10.0.0.1",
  "packetCount": 500,
  "byteCount": 32000
}

### 2.2 Ingest Normal Traffic (Another Safe IP)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/traffic/ingest
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "sourceIp": "192.168.1.10",
  "destinationIp": "10.0.0.1",
  "packetCount": 1000,
  "byteCount": 64000
}

### 2.3 Query Recent Traffic (Last 5 minutes)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/traffic/query?range=-5m
Accept: application/json

### 2.4 Query Traffic (Last 1 hour)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/traffic/query?range=-1h
Accept: application/json

### 2.5 Get Traffic Summary (Last 1 hour)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/traffic/summary?duration=1h
Accept: application/json

### 2.6 Get Visualization Data (Last 1 hour, 5 min intervals)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/traffic/visualization?duration=1h&interval=5m
Accept: application/json


###############################################################################
# 3. TRAFFIC MANAGEMENT - Attack Traffic
###############################################################################

### 3.1 Ingest Attack Traffic (High Volume - Should be blocked)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/traffic/ingest
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "sourceIp": "203.0.113.99",
  "destinationIp": "10.0.0.1",
  "packetCount": 150000,
  "byteCount": 9600000
}

### 3.2 Ingest Attack Traffic (Another Malicious IP)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/traffic/ingest
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "sourceIp": "45.33.32.156",
  "destinationIp": "10.0.0.1",
  "packetCount": 125000,
  "byteCount": 8000000
}

### 3.3 Ingest Borderline Traffic (Medium Risk)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/traffic/ingest
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "sourceIp": "198.51.100.50",
  "destinationIp": "10.0.0.1",
  "packetCount": 50000,
  "byteCount": 3200000
}


